  "bodyText": "Skip to content\nMen\nWomen\nAccessories\nTotal items in cart: 0\nThe Terry Short\nPelican / S\n$105.00 CAD\nAdd to cart\nThe Terry Short\n$105.00 CAD\nColorPelican\nSize\nS\nM\nL\nXL\nXXL\n3XL\nDecrease quantity\nIncrease quantity\nAdd to cart\nBuy it now\n\nMade from super-soft 100% organic cotton, the laidback Terry Shorts pair with the Terry Camp Shirt for tropical relaxation on the most sun-soaked of summer days. Featuring an airy, towel-like and all-natural terry knit, they’re a step up in both style and comfort after a long day in the water.\n\nThis is a demonstration store. You can purchase products like this from ANIÁN.\n\nMADE WITH CARE\n\nHEIRLOOM QUALITY\n\nSATISFACTION GUARANTEED\n\nCLASSIC STYLING\n\nSTYLED WITH\nOpen image in full screen\nOpen image in full screen\nOpen image in full screen\nOpen image in full screen\nOpen image in full screen\nOpen image in full screen\nOpen image in full screen\nOpen image in full screen\nOpen image in full screen\nOpen image in full screen\nOpen image in full screen\nOpen image in full screen\nMaterials\n\nSustainable, natural textiles can be enjoyed for generations to come.\n\nCare\n\nWash only when necessary using cold water and a gentle detergent.\n\nDetails\n\nHand-picked accents give this piece an understated unique look.\n\nYou may also like\n\nAbout us\n\nOur passion is sustainable, natural textiles. We create garments that can be enjoyed for generations to come.\n\nShop\nBestsellers\nMen\nWomen\nAccessories\nSupport\nFAQ\nContact\nFit guide\nGarment care\nOur story\nAbout us\nField notes\n© 2026 Heritage, Powered by Shopify"
